{"seq":3,"slug":"delivery-failure-suppression-compliance","title":"投递失败、退订抑制与合规治理（推送限额与反垃圾）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/notification-delivery-realtime/delivery-failure-suppression-compliance","wordCount":2730,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"投递失败-退订抑制与合规治理-推送限额与反垃圾\">投递失败、退订抑制与合规治理（推送限额与反垃圾）</h1><p>一次大促的降价提醒，结局可能不是&quot;发出去&quot;，而是网关回 <code>410</code>、用户关掉横幅、平台把应用标成骚扰来源。前一篇 <a href=\"alert-delivery-pipeline-idempotency\">提醒投递管道：幂等、去重与重试</a> 解决&quot;同一条提醒发几次&quot;；这一篇解决&quot;该不该发、发不出去之后系统学到什么&quot;。失败处理与抑制治理是同一条反馈回路的两端：投递结果不只决定本次成败，还决定下一轮要不要继续给这个令牌、用户、通道发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-失败分类与抑制的三层目标\">核心概念：失败分类与抑制的三层目标</h2><p>把失败当成布尔量是治理失败最常见的原因。&quot;发送失败&quot;至少分四类，处置、可重试性、状态写入完全不同。混淆产生两种对称灾难：把硬失败当软失败重试，是给已卸载应用的令牌永久发送，白白消耗配额并拉低送达率；把软失败当硬失败丢弃，是错过一次限流抖动，让用户永远收不到那条提醒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[投递请求] --&gt; B{网关响应}&#10;  B --&gt;|200| C[记 SENT]&#10;  B --&gt;|400 403 404 405 413| D[请求/配置错误&lt;br/&gt;不重试·告警人工]&#10;  B --&gt;|410 Unregistered| E[硬失败&lt;br/&gt;失效并删除令牌]&#10;  B --&gt;|404 Web Push| F[订阅过期&lt;br/&gt;重建订阅]&#10;  B --&gt;|429| G[限流&lt;br/&gt;按 Retry-After 退避]&#10;  B --&gt;|500 503| H[服务端错误&lt;br/&gt;指数退避+抖动]&#10;  E --&gt; I[(抑制名单)]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[下一轮跳过&lt;br/&gt;不再产生请求]\">graph TD\n  A[投递请求] --&gt; B{网关响应}\n  B --&gt;|200| C[记 SENT]\n  B --&gt;|400 403 404 405 413| D[请求/配置错误&lt;br/&gt;不重试·告警人工]\n  B --&gt;|410 Unregistered| E[硬失败&lt;br/&gt;失效并删除令牌]\n  B --&gt;|404 Web Push| F[订阅过期&lt;br/&gt;重建订阅]\n  B --&gt;|429| G[限流&lt;br/&gt;按 Retry-After 退避]\n  B --&gt;|500 503| H[服务端错误&lt;br/&gt;指数退避+抖动]\n  E --&gt; I[(抑制名单)]\n  F --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[下一轮跳过&lt;br/&gt;不再产生请求]</pre><p>抑制的目标有三层，优先级从下往上递增：<strong>通道正确性</strong>（不再向无效地址发送）、<strong>用户体验</strong>（不再向已退订/静音的用户发送）、<strong>平台合规</strong>（不触发商店与法规惩罚）。下层做不好会上溯污染上层——无效令牌的持续重试抬高失败率，失败率被平台解读为骚扰信号，最终触发下架或限封。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类型</th>\n<th>典型响应</th>\n<th>可重试性</th>\n<th>写入的系统状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求/配置错误</td>\n<td><code>400</code> <code>403</code> <code>404</code> <code>405</code> <code>413</code></td>\n<td>否（须先改请求）</td>\n<td>告警工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬失败（令牌失效）</td>\n<td>APNs <code>410 Unregistered</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>令牌置 <code>active=false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅过期</td>\n<td>Web Push <code>404 Not Found</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>订阅标记重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td><code>429 TooManyRequests</code></td>\n<td>是（退避）</td>\n<td>计数器，不改令牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端错误</td>\n<td><code>500</code> <code>503</code></td>\n<td>是（退避）</td>\n<td>不改令牌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"硬失败-令牌失效与反馈回路\">硬失败：令牌失效与反馈回路</h2><p>APNs 的 HTTP/2 接口没有独立的历史反馈服务，令牌失效直接在发送响应里返回：<code>410 Unregistered</code> 表示该令牌在此 topic 与环境下已失效（来源：Apple, <em>Sending notification requests to APNs</em>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/sending-notification-requests-to-apns）。响应体的\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/sending-notification-requests-to-apns）。响应体的</a> <code>timestamp</code> 是 APNs 确认失效的毫秒时间戳，是正确合并的关键：若设备在此之后重新注册，用旧时间戳覆盖会误杀新令牌。</p>\n<p><code>environment</code> 必须纳入主键范围：sandbox 令牌在 production 下必然 <code>400 BadDeviceToken</code>；Apple 明确要求<strong>不要</strong>把 <code>400 BadDeviceToken</code> 或 <code>DeviceTokenNotForTopic</code> 当失效处理，它们通常意味着令牌格式、topic 或环境配错。\nWeb Push 的语义与 APNs 相反：<code>404 Not Found</code> 才是订阅已过期或被删除——RFC 8030 规定过期订阅必须用 <code>404</code> 信号，且推送服务&quot;MAY expire a subscription at any time&quot;；<code>410 Gone</code> 指某条消息最终无法送达，<strong>不是</strong>订阅被删除（来源：IETF, <em>RFC 8030</em>, <a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8030）。把\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8030）。把</a> Web Push <code>410</code> 当订阅失效来删，会清掉仍有效的订阅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软失败与限流-令牌桶-退避与网关节流\">软失败与限流：令牌桶、退避与网关节流</h2><p>FCM 的 HTTP v1 接口用<strong>令牌桶</strong>做配额：文档给出的量级是&quot;每分钟令牌桶 60 万配额令牌&quot;，桶在每分钟末重置（来源：Firebase, <em>Scaling and throttling</em>, <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/docs/cloud-messaging/scale-fcm）。两个反直觉后果：把整桶在头几秒用光会造成开/关振荡；即使用量看似低于配额，仍可能收到\">https://firebase.google.com/docs/cloud-messaging/scale-fcm）。两个反直觉后果：把整桶在头几秒用光会造成开/关振荡；即使用量看似低于配额，仍可能收到</a> <code>429</code>，因为监控与配额执行在时间上并不对齐。</p>\n<p>因此流量必须<strong>渐进爬坡</strong>，而不是把目标 RPS 一次性打满。官方建议至少用 60 秒从零 ramp 到目标速率；滚动扩大流量时按 1% → 5% → 10% → 25% → 50% → 75% → 100% 分步，每步 soak 一天到一周。退避必须带抖动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>delay</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>重试次数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{delay} = \\min\\bigl(d_{\\max},\\; 2^{k}\\bigr) \\cdot (1 + U(0,1) \\cdot j),\\qquad k = \\text{重试次数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重试次数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动系数。带 <code>Retry-After</code> 时以它为准；不带时 FCM 建议等 60 秒，重试间隔不小于 10 秒。超过 60 分钟仍在失败，基本可判定为不可重试错误被误分类，或网关正在故障。</p>\n<p>APNs 侧不公布固定请求上限（来源同 Apple 文档）。收到 <code>429</code> 应立即降速并遵守 <code>Retry-After</code>，无该头则用指数退避加抖动；连接层面必须复用持久 HTTP/2 连接，因为连接建立开销本身会在峰值时成为新的限流来源。投递层回报的&quot;令牌失效&quot;还须<strong>回写</strong>订阅实体，让 <a href=\"../restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a> 在后续边沿上跳过该用户，而不是每轮重试注定失败的投递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退订抑制-从偏好中心到强制抑制名单\">退订抑制：从偏好中心到强制抑制名单</h2><p>退订在工程上是一条<strong>状态机加时限</strong>，不是&quot;用户点了个按钮&quot;。CAN-SPAM 给出可直接落地的硬约束：每封商业邮件都必须提供清晰显眼的退订说明，退订机制在发信后至少 <strong>30 天</strong>内保持有效；用户退订后必须在 <strong>10 个工作日</strong>内执行；退订地址不得出售或转让。每条不合规邮件最高可处 <strong>53,088 美元</strong>民事罚款（2024 年 1 月通胀调整值，来源：FTC, <em>CAN-SPAM Act: A Compliance Guide for Business</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）。处罚**按邮件条数**计，一个没接上抑制名单的批处理任务，法律风险随发送量线性放大。实现上，抑制必须落在发送链路的**前置闸门**，而非事后过滤：\">https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）。处罚**按邮件条数**计，一个没接上抑制名单的批处理任务，法律风险随发送量线性放大。实现上，抑制必须落在发送链路的**前置闸门**，而非事后过滤：</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选收件人] --&gt; B{全局抑制名单?}&#10;  B --&gt;|命中| X[丢弃·零成本]&#10;  B --&gt;|未命中| C{该通道独立退订?}&#10;  C --&gt;|已退订/未订阅| X&#10;  C --&gt;|可发| D{推送预算未耗尽?}&#10;  D --&gt;|耗尽| E[降级到低打扰通道]&#10;  D --&gt;|有余量| F[投递&lt;br/&gt;硬退信/投诉写回抑制名单]\">graph TD\n  A[候选收件人] --&gt; B{全局抑制名单?}\n  B --&gt;|命中| X[丢弃·零成本]\n  B --&gt;|未命中| C{该通道独立退订?}\n  C --&gt;|已退订/未订阅| X\n  C --&gt;|可发| D{推送预算未耗尽?}\n  D --&gt;|耗尽| E[降级到低打扰通道]\n  D --&gt;|有余量| F[投递&lt;br/&gt;硬退信/投诉写回抑制名单]</pre><p>退订必须是<strong>按通道独立</strong>的。用户在邮件里点退订，不等于关闭 App 推送；合并成单一开关，在合规上是过度抑制（损害转化），在体验上是抑制不足（用户以为已退订却仍收到推送，转而投诉）。真实偏好模型要落到 <a href=\"channel-preference-quiet-hours-model\">通道偏好与免打扰时段模型</a>，每个通道、每种提醒类型各有一个独立同意位。</p>\n<p>邮件通道还有一层平台强制力。Amazon SES 维护<strong>账户级</strong>抑制名单：硬退信或垃圾投诉自动加入，之后所有 identity 都不再向其发送；平台建议维持<strong>退信率低于 5%</strong>、<strong>投诉率低于 0.1%</strong>，触到即进入声誉审查，升至约 <strong>10% 退信率</strong>或 <strong>0.5% 投诉率</strong>时可能暂停发送（来源：AWS, <em>Amazon SES sending FAQs</em>, <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ses/latest/dg/faqs-sending.html）。降价提醒本该低投诉，一旦被误标垃圾，损失的不是一次活动而是整个账户的发送能力。\">https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ses/latest/dg/faqs-sending.html）。降价提醒本该低投诉，一旦被误标垃圾，损失的不是一次活动而是整个账户的发送能力。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"平台合规与反垃圾-商店规则与系统级降级\">平台合规与反垃圾：商店规则与系统级降级</h2><p>应用商店规则把&quot;发什么&quot;变成可导致下架的硬约束。App Store 审核指南 <strong>4.5.4</strong> 规定：推送不得是应用运行的必要条件，不得发送敏感个人信息；<strong>除非用户在应用内 UI 中以明确同意语言显式选择加入，且应用内提供退订方式，否则不得用于促销或直接营销</strong>（来源：Apple, <em>App Store Review Guidelines</em> §4.5.4, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/）。滥用可能导致权限被撤销。降价提醒处在&quot;促销&quot;与&quot;服务通知&quot;的灰区，稳妥做法是首次订阅时用独立同意语言明示目的，而非把开关捆绑在总推送权限里。\">https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/）。滥用可能导致权限被撤销。降价提醒处在&quot;促销&quot;与&quot;服务通知&quot;的灰区，稳妥做法是首次订阅时用独立同意语言明示目的，而非把开关捆绑在总推送权限里。</a></p>\n<p>iOS 还有一层系统级投递降级，会让&quot;已批准&quot;看起来像&quot;没送达&quot;。<strong>临时授权</strong>（provisional authorization）允许应用不发权限对话框即投递通知，但通知<strong>非打扰</strong>地静默进入通知中心，无声音与横幅；<strong>定时摘要</strong>（Scheduled Summary）收集非紧急通知，按用户选定时间批量投递，应用无法控制投递时刻；<strong>专注模式</strong>会静默或延迟普通通知。<code>interruptionLevel</code> 决定能否穿透：<code>.passive</code> 不打扰，<code>.active</code> 是标准可见通知但受专注与摘要限制，<code>.timeSensitive</code> 可穿透且需专门能力，<code>.critical</code> 需 Apple 特批 entitlement（来源：Apple, <em>Asking permission to use notifications</em>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/asking-permission-to-use-notifications）。降价提醒属价格波动，应用\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/asking-permission-to-use-notifications）。降价提醒属价格波动，应用</a> <code>.active</code> 甚至 <code>.passive</code>；把营销提醒标成 <code>time-sensitive</code> 是&quot;滥用&quot;的判定证据。</p>\n<p>Android 侧，Android 13 起通知需要运行时权限 <code>POST_NOTIFICATIONS</code>。Google Play 的 <em>Device and Network Abuse</em> 政策禁止应用用 full-screen intent 权限&quot;强迫用户与干扰性广告或通知交互&quot;，并要求前台服务不得超出必要时间运行、须可被停止、须伴随准确清晰的通知（来源：Google Play, <em>Device and Network Abuse</em>, <a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9888379）。含义是：**补货检测必须落在服务端**，不能用持续前台服务轮询库存来绕开\">https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9888379）。含义是：**补货检测必须落在服务端**，不能用持续前台服务轮询库存来绕开</a> FCM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限频与推送预算-把-发多少-变成可调参数\">限频与推送预算：把&quot;发多少&quot;变成可调参数</h2><p>合规是底线，&quot;发到用户不反感&quot;才是运营目标，两者都落在同一个工程对象上：<strong>每用户的推送预算</strong>。预算把发送权从&quot;有事件就发&quot;改为&quot;有额度才发&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>type</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>近 24h 该用户已发数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(m) = w_{\\text{type}}(m) \\times w_{\\text{channel}}(m) \\times f(\\text{近 24h 该用户已发数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">type</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">近</span><span class=\"mord\"> 24h </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该用户已发数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>type</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{type}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">type</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按提醒类型赋权（到货/大幅降价高于日常波动），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映打扰强度（短信高于推送高于邮件）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 随近期发送量递增，使第 N 条通知的边际成本上升，正是抑制高频用户被打扰的机制。预算耗尽时不是丢弃，而是<strong>沿通道阶梯降级</strong>：<code>推送 → 站内信 → 邮件摘要 → 静默只更新角标</code>。</p>\n<p>限频还有一个常被忽略的对象：<strong>同一商品、同一变体的并发订阅</strong>。补货边沿命中时，一个用户可能在多个心愿单里订阅了同一变体，或同一变体的多个触发条件同时成立。去重必须在<strong>用户 × 变体 × 时间窗</strong>粒度完成，而不是订阅粒度——合并键要回到 <a href=\"../wishlist-entity-catalog-model/wishlist-item-entity-schema\">心愿单条目实体模型</a> 定义的变体身份上，否则用户会收到指向同一商品的两条通知，观感与骚扰无异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>失败分四类（请求错误、硬失败、订阅过期、限流/服务端错误），处置、可重试性、状态写入各不相同；混淆是治理失败的头号来源。</li>\n<li>APNs <code>410 Unregistered</code> 须先比较响应体 <code>timestamp</code> 与 <code>last_registered_ms</code> 再失效令牌，并用 topic+environment 限定范围；Web Push 相反，<code>404</code> 才是订阅过期。</li>\n<li>FCM 配额是每分钟令牌桶（60 万量级），须渐进爬坡；退避加抖动用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k (1 + U(0,1)j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>Retry-After</code> 优先。</li>\n<li>退订是状态机加时限：CAN-SPAM 要求 10 个工作日内执行、退订机制存活 30 天、每条违规最高 53,088 美元；SES 账户级抑制名单自动吸收硬退信与投诉，退信率 &lt;5%、投诉率 &lt;0.1% 是账户存续前提。</li>\n<li>App Store 4.5.4 要求促销推送显式 opt-in 且可退订；iOS 临时授权、定时摘要与专注模式会静默降级投递，<code>time-sensitive</code> 不可用于营销。</li>\n<li>推送预算与通道阶梯降级把&quot;发多少&quot;变成可调参数；同用户 × 同变体的时间窗去重避免观感骚扰。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"投递失败、退订抑制与合规治理（推送限额与反垃圾）","id":"投递失败-退订抑制与合规治理-推送限额与反垃圾"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：失败分类与抑制的三层目标","id":"核心概念-失败分类与抑制的三层目标"},{"level":2,"text":"硬失败：令牌失效与反馈回路","id":"硬失败-令牌失效与反馈回路"},{"level":2,"text":"软失败与限流：令牌桶、退避与网关节流","id":"软失败与限流-令牌桶-退避与网关节流"},{"level":2,"text":"退订抑制：从偏好中心到强制抑制名单","id":"退订抑制-从偏好中心到强制抑制名单"},{"level":2,"text":"平台合规与反垃圾：商店规则与系统级降级","id":"平台合规与反垃圾-商店规则与系统级降级"},{"level":2,"text":"限频与推送预算：把\"发多少\"变成可调参数","id":"限频与推送预算-把-发多少-变成可调参数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提醒投递管道：幂等、去重、重试与实时性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/notification-delivery-realtime/alert-delivery-pipeline-idempotency"},"next":{"title":"提醒转化归因模型与核心指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/conversion-merchandising-ops/alert-conversion-attribution-metrics"}}